  "title": "An awake creature might have no conscious states",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "86f7c25f-8bd8-40c9-abcd-dd4fd5135118",
      "text": "Creature consciousness does not imply state consciousness. Since many states of an alert person are not conscious, there may be creatures none of whose mental states are conscious even when they are fully awake.",
